        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "message is empty), a private SECC not in CPM4PE shall send in the \"ServerHello\" message its own certificate chain (PE certificate chain) including any necessary cross-certificates up to a root (excluding the root certificate itself) of its own choosing.",
