            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2387] If the EVCC offers and private SECC chooses a named group and signature algorithm based on curves as defined by [V2G20-2319] (as per the configurable mechanism as defined by [V2G20-2320]), the PE certificate chain provided by the private SECC in the \"ServerHello\" message shall be based on profiles as defined in B.10.2.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                523,
